115
00:08:35,724 --> 00:08:42,678
How did a force push get through?"", and
Exercise 24.6, "Verified, and she was on a

116
00:08:42,718 --> 00:08:43,268
plane".

117
00:08:43,608 --> 00:08:48,141
For each, before you write anything else,
